== Walkthrough ==

You can get 12 words needed for high level Necromancer pet research from the 3 Sisters (X`Ta Tempi, Timpi, and Tompi) in Neriak Foreign Quarter (-10, -45).  It is easier to get them though randomly looting creatures than by doing the quests. 

Tompi will give you the following words: 

<li> {{:Words of Allure}}</li>
<ul><li>{{:Charred Pearl}} (Unrest)<br>
</li><li>{{:Ruby}} (Bought and Dropped randomly)<br>
</li><li>{{:Wand}} (Mistmoore off of a glyphed familiar)<br>
</li><li>{{:Bloodstone}} (Bought/Dropped)<br>
</li></ul>


<li> {{:Words of Dark Paths}}</li>
<ul><li>{{:Sphere of Unrest}} (Unrest) <br>
</li><li>{{:Eye of Urd}} (Guk) <br>
</li><li>{{:Star Rose Quartz}} (Bought) <br>
</li></ul>
 

<li> {{:Words of Obligation}}</li>
<ul><li>{{:Globe of Fear}} (Oasis or Feerrott from Spectres) <br> 
</li><li>{{:Eye of Jin}} (Guk) <br> 
</li><li>{{:Jade}} (Bought/Dropped) <br> 
</li></ul>


<li>  {{:Words of Acquisition (Beza)}}</li>
<ul><li>{{:Fetid Skin}} (Plane of Fear) <br>
</li><li>{{:Scare Straw}} (Plane of Fear) <br>
</li><li>{{:Turmoil Warts}} (Plane of Fear) <br>
</li><li>{{:Pearl}} (Bought/Dropped) <br>
</li></ul>


